      "message": "The power_button_is_stable was introduced to fix a bug, i.e.\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/244590\n\nIt is like:\n (1) power button interrupt, release -\u003e press, but not debounced\n (2) this function is called -\u003e we should wait here until it is stable and released\n\nIf like this change, to check the !power_button_is_pressed() first, the function exits and doesn\u0027t wait.",
